<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Remove Curse</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Healer (guild level 18), Necromancer (guild level 24), Paladin (guild level 24, up to 50%)
Also taught by: Brother Norcia, at the monastery in the vineyards near Nymgaard (from level 80)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast remove curse &lt;target&gt;
cast remove curse &lt;object&gt;   (lying in the room)
</pre>
<p>When your prayer is answered, a curse is lifted from the target, and one 
curse each from all the things they carry and wear, at once. Cast on an 
object lying in the room, it lifts a curse from the object and from what 
is inside it; for something you carry, cast it on yourself.
</p><p>Something cursed more than once needs another cast for each curse. You must 
be standing, not fighting. Practising it needs divine 40. It is also 
found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Curse</a>
